		{
			"id":"ae098633cc0fd836",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Room Info\n\nA red room that makes you lose gold everytime you enter it.\n\nThere are seven angels on the glass windows.\n\nAngel 1 - [[Rynna - Paragon of Gardening.canvas|Rynna - Paragon of Gardening]]\nAngel 5 - Mila\nAngel 7 - [[Orynda - Angel.canvas|Orynda - Angel]]\n\nIf you light the candles on the altar, it reveals a pig bank item, which allows you to retrieve all gold donated to the Chapel at once, by breaking the pig bank.\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-300,
			"y":-1234,
			"width":600,
			"height":394
		},
